{"id":279535316,"title":"1.","summary":"1.认识框架","content":"<p><strong>1.认识框架</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785391691273-2615839b-d34b-4058-8a82-ba06340867ee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785391736150-3d6433a8-cf8f-42ef-8db8-33f4d8f7b113.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785391806368-5d667920-8c2a-4f38-9f16-9b069ea8f887.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785391956631-5a7319b5-cb78-4168-b214-82d4fde67138.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392278872-17938512-f88d-4521-ac21-a698dc8efed5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.uniapp目录结构</strong></p>\n<p>下载这个工具<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392317394-fe7b2510-264d-42bb-90fd-306eb9b779cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392330125-81d32733-77ff-4141-baca-11a51ff5d20b.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392338202-8a80f848-8e3e-47be-b4f7-a59580da5fd5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>全局样式文件</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392437420-bc94a53f-0822-4707-8dba-2eb46455f769.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>需要配置什么就在这里。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392621282-a75e2ee9-db1c-4f2c-9003-515268a63243.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>多个组件组成一个网页。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785392886300-e22af470-b49c-48e4-a77b-639b70d3c627.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>3.认识和使用条件编译</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393038943-ffaf9ce1-83e6-4cd1-b8aa-e7fa4f3435a6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393195322-a0fe2017-e8f4-4345-90ea-dec56146b75e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393283900-735784e0-c100-4f0f-a1d8-f1b88555aa73.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393296909-e0d2e427-c64f-4b23-aad3-ca0f491ceedb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393303993-845a035d-1cc3-452e-bdb3-88babf48dc05.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393349957-715dbea6-aa82-4716-ba1e-ba80be767da1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>4.基础语法</strong></p>\n<p>也由这三部分构成<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393394338-dec72ae3-a5ee-46e8-8585-18a2c3ad525d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393441436-f238f618-70e7-4383-951f-b81b5868a578.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393602718-42af87f2-fe74-45b7-a648-d5210cade13c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393613839-dc354a04-5528-45d3-ab48-95159faefe43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393655907-06679fee-cd80-40dc-9536-4213341e81b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393703885-b0ff8b54-8a48-45e4-a40f-d657277d6515.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们经常用的是rpx<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393746298-e33ad54b-960b-4bc5-b925-cd783649ef19.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785393760533-c510a9a8-2488-4bbd-819d-cde3f1ec44d5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>可以去修改宽度<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394144190-4aecb2b9-439b-4a3e-97ad-9d2f23248d11.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394205529-3463703a-c5e1-4e04-b0d4-a63146cf2956.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394324129-bfb399eb-cc39-45ba-b819-a8b990795cf6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394350449-e33b9e0f-51f9-4758-8bd0-4b72699ff89b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>5.真机调试</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394393332-9636b415-508e-4896-9645-88de32bf233c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394420041-6b2b771d-1b56-45a3-b65e-afda3e93884e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>做什么小程序，首先就去下载什么小程序的开发者工具，再去运行编译<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394527408-8ff92f8e-408d-4a19-b6aa-d53d0ea7e9c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394596993-4e4dcbac-e84e-44a0-a5c3-7588658f2b07.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394617973-b2bde1f6-b5cf-451b-a050-45f9f6bc5d89.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394632196-a2d2bb21-5f76-4802-bbbe-f0c823ee9c99.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394703376-5b2f43be-3a52-402a-b5a3-c1c77ccfcd56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>6.生命周期</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394720158-36a0ecc1-534f-45b6-b255-97814e8159ab.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394751646-11fa3423-777d-4e85-a06d-fc3eebd82948.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394831315-ff5dd5e5-3a36-4911-a04e-d1247dc1d78c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394818529-62a71d6b-a56c-442f-85ea-a6b2ad2160d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>部分<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394910617-f17b7a08-bb0d-4ea8-a145-32d823c3ba6d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他不是在pages下新创建的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785394925150-e239c344-3201-44d0-885e-e7eb2bea5518.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785395181976-7287b402-6893-4ccf-8509-aaa8ce21d776.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>从首进入到新闻业<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785395205084-dfac3681-50f1-4352-b312-b05606980bb6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们接参数要在onLoad这里。onshow接不到参数的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396001637-b9da5858-7cde-4bf6-ae2a-5b470b8973e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>onReady：可以渲染DOM，拿到数据</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396137892-05521af3-cb3d-4975-ac1a-00c0dc5a24d6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396201532-ed368fbc-8575-4536-9b68-2b7ace47a883.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396325127-1d972fd3-83ad-4991-8b51-1faa31256e9e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396346665-0472f4ce-e17b-47b3-a369-56b45d25037b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>7.路由页面跳转</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396442647-fcca3d11-abb3-4998-8320-d17676ca0f9a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396412386-e38e14ed-a2e9-4930-bf77-7beede49bb95.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他无法返回上一个页面了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396418459-b18beafa-82e6-4477-bf75-09787319fb14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396514518-f18f52cd-2e9b-4929-aa87-32983f00bd6d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396526781-b5737645-b439-4ad3-975e-1aa5eb2822f0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们不配置这个，无法跳转<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396562605-fbea6df7-bf7d-40e5-b0a6-bd3d3488d626.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们也要配置这个<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396810086-2bca5103-ea67-40f2-9e3e-f55ad0a378eb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396917019-02472520-4c9a-479c-b087-56b21f4e18ae.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>组件跳转<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396861286-80c3c51e-c260-483d-bee3-ba907acd0c19.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396877640-75ae2f99-2d99-4770-8d7e-0024b7ceb8c2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785396931771-fd571967-2bfe-47be-9ef7-17b706c05caa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>8.传值</strong></p>\n<p>我们要跳转页面，先要去配置那里设置了先，不然跳不了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397097030-e8fefe71-484b-4ea9-b2c8-64e1c73ba909.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>传值</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397251584-956cd363-d422-4702-8ae7-a517ef55e09b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397187204-f4686565-9451-4e5f-bbb3-7149303cac83.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397200219-e56147b4-2434-48c2-baf8-f4bd59405b51.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397222758-6fba4f73-4d0c-423b-97a7-0feadfdd5e3b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397230170-75aa5fbe-61b4-475c-a163-2f8bb79dd7ab.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397296223-d430ef99-b3e3-44e1-9b6c-633b16c04a0c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>父传子</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397420265-5ecc0d80-7759-45e2-a797-2110b8dbc56d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397463739-50ea9fc0-ac86-4967-b5e0-2e5a5beba41b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397477989-2846ef26-e605-43c4-aa9e-1547aca5da30.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>子传父</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397549134-e575e55d-829e-49af-b757-63915246b90f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397653080-2203a4ee-78ab-4a74-b07c-f423395886b8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要知道点击的是谁<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397688145-fe66de54-f641-4275-a3f9-0554f0ca3585.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397734285-15cbcf10-5326-4475-b18c-61a2cba7882c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397817690-0f795b0b-76a3-4fc8-b377-42db85c6a9e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们点击了他就返回到这个页面，控制台也打印出了我们点击的地方<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397845819-b149f574-36d5-4cf7-bd49-5b2539bbecd9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785397883989-49d49d05-a8ad-4373-a075-b7bf2c910d77.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>9.全局文件pages中pages配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398063818-45a6f1b6-0c6b-4f57-a213-b10b20066c35.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们新创建的news不配置的话，我们是跳转不了的。有文件也不行，在浏览器直接搜索也不行的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398129507-b848357c-9544-434d-86df-da1793756c21.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398203180-46c49dfa-6e3a-4004-ab67-a211e485e6c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398342058-44f53456-d0ed-4565-9b07-790cbdf00a55.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398361530-a9d1ae9c-abf0-498d-90d0-d8d9bf7bbd25.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>开启下拉刷新<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398421372-81ca1158-9dee-40d1-bdc5-7b0880602ef6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要配合这个<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398463991-a7dec6ac-49cd-439b-89c6-5fb70a53fe23.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398485293-73ef13f4-a516-4b40-bad1-b2978d5a680b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398477523-7f5a1a5e-1a10-4bb2-8510-43e55bd60389.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398508046-59f52f4b-044c-492a-af71-52b2d3a90596.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398662179-4cc252ea-bca1-4b97-85a9-1561717a1858.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398535775-8a576142-6483-4c69-8b58-a3cab715051c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398577931-1c42b7dd-2bb0-4315-be55-aae6c80e3cb3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他是全局的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398605873-12a0671e-5229-4391-9008-d2313b239e08.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>10.全局文件pages中tabBar配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398709550-5d91d9b1-7147-4af9-b1c4-175f5ea5e864.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398758514-7feda87f-ce39-427c-9f7f-0dca3a674cb2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398775557-30dbf45e-6a72-47dd-9580-c74f718ab5fa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398879356-2f309dd2-fce4-4b49-a9bd-17ee1d62144b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>在tabBar这里配置完还要在他的上面配置pages</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785398849909-f056a15c-5222-47a0-8954-8958e6072185.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399094321-b05a58aa-00c8-4d59-880d-f5fdcb196529.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>11.全局文件pages中easycom配置</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399228673-a9cae5ee-610e-44e9-9cc7-e00963e03966.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个是ui组件库<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399266472-6afa69d1-b7cb-4129-8886-195a027fa48e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399348614-c3988d2d-fffb-4b92-b646-bf9762b515c5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399340500-df22e3eb-fa0a-45b8-b829-e81fcaf64275.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399360956-89826c97-9f10-4640-8625-28f47fe4f292.png\" alt=\"\"> </p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399374323-4c847c2b-eec8-4ef7-bf5e-def2c8d65109.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399431479-391e82ee-84be-4a46-96d2-bbd0208da070.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399448177-3d61c019-39d2-4c99-b2d8-fd4c2712a7cc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>12.全局文件pages中appPlus配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399542204-ba47e913-9272-4618-8a0d-e61b326c6d57.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他是这里去写的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399572196-d7678397-3b5d-4267-876b-841ac33e9717.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399670686-71d73ef3-8a7c-4993-897e-3c4f7c5ed164.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399693969-2d5b0178-7bf7-4ce9-b611-b56b30bbbd36.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399723383-5ce9c71a-7ae9-4028-b0cf-fc69c3fe835d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>图标也要写他的路径<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399767583-ce010e80-204a-41f3-a238-815b421deac0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399740518-9f216c23-4604-4933-b28b-ccbc82965bcc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>配合那个分享的图标去实现</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400016951-d450f49e-09f5-4d56-bc91-a262bb54d013.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785399877578-2519cb81-4093-4803-826f-99ce19ff28f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400000782-b06c6491-346d-4695-baf0-8f02e19dd6db.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400030675-31d9ea5e-a35a-4497-b997-55fa2474a079.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400068272-08843616-e792-4103-918b-c759eef86b94.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400061439-394e6d3a-fd24-4785-87b1-0b25fd310e9b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>比较重要的是这两个了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400079058-6ed988d9-8206-42c4-bec3-2722d4829b15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>13.mainfest配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400242307-4538e2a3-aa1f-4671-8b25-7d7b45f35d14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400231921-d028fc9c-0606-4121-b27f-f6047fa9b159.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400254726-5f668084-32d1-49ed-b505-0db5aad445b7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们需要自己去弄这个key<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400326382-dd447807-b8c9-42c3-9924-197046ffa18e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400297254-746b672f-e702-4b10-8667-1a914fc58960.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400339258-7b636373-d241-4fe5-aad3-b1d52d455708.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要通过ip地址来打开的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400356902-52a70fcd-dabc-4538-adad-b3e46d5ec495.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>14.mainfest源码视图</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400445868-6bfc21f6-d685-4220-a886-f901fc01e099.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400530904-03712663-8030-4e80-a0c5-d900f817ab9f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个源码配置还在1要咨询ai，跟着搞好一点。</p>\n<p>他是为了解决新旧版本工具的问题</p>\n<p><strong>15uniapp打包上线微信小程序</strong></p>\n<p>点击这里<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400623228-ac71b895-6f2e-41ec-a0f6-cdbbf412198d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要拿到这个appid（开发者身份）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400660434-dbe86a10-557e-4279-b4c0-7b61b1b33685.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400715051-abcd79a9-be28-4ad2-babe-1bc9dcdfd9ac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400720171-d80dea37-c669-4c3d-8933-fb9f128852b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>权限<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400741041-8bec6d61-4916-4960-b41c-47fae93d5d42.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400923815-eb16e2a3-cd5c-485a-b378-98e26bdcfa62.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400784061-e791e72a-f200-4e95-a33f-daa306af8864.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>会有这些<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400800259-324edebf-7ebe-4c3b-a0b5-7f2c76c896f3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400853101-53de609b-6eb4-435b-9b84-8c851e0be095.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400874468-7c3805fa-9cde-44b6-82d3-3cccd904fa6e.png\" alt=\"\">在</p>\n<p>在前面那个网址那里可以去申请证书相关的东西。</p>\n<p>对于ios的话，我们跟着步骤走就好了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785400975507-e4796c5c-371f-47c0-995d-85b78102f500.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>他有两个证书，但是流程是一样的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785401021221-5d01a5bc-67ff-40ee-b804-2a8af0f8778c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785401036658-9ebadbfd-f7c5-4d82-b412-af89c9f1e5b7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>申请完了会有这个<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1785401054558-98eeb2e7-9ac5-4009-b3f6-677f4224a39f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":81829238,"category":{"id":81829238,"name":"小程序","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-30T06:03:29.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T08:45:19.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/spxlab/nl2govvgpct6lmtz","slug":"nl2govvgpct6lmtz","wordCount":619}